        "b": 708.41462
      },
      "content": "i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor routine operation",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0873",
      "reading_order": 1007,
      "section": "Measurement interval",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.001329999999996,
        "t": 701.64183,
        "r": 146.57133,
        "b": 690.40183
      },
      "content": "Measurement interval",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0874",
      "reading_order": 1008,
      "section": "Measurement interval",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00133,
        "t": 689.64183,
        "r": 553.6013300000005,
        "b": 666.40183
      },
      "content": "This table shows the measurement intervals for the condition monitor during normal operation and when the monitor is in alarm mode."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0048",
      "reading_order": 1009,
      "section": "Measurement interval",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 142.66099548339844,
        "t": 666.5542449951172,
        "r": 558.7608642578125,
        "b": 619.5875549316406
      },
      "markdown": "| Mode                  | Measurement interval   |\n|-----------------------|------------------------|\n| Normal operating mode | Five minutes           |\n| Alarm mode            | Two minutes            |",
      "rows": 3,
      "cols": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0875",
      "reading_order": 1010,
      "section": "Measurement interval",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 610.10183,
        "r": 557.0700000000005,
        "b": 574.8618299999999
      },
      "content": "When the condition monitor measures a reading beyond the specified temperature and vibration limits, the appropriate red LED flashes. After the process or pump condition that causes the alarm is corrected, the condition monitor returns to normal mode after one normal-level measurement."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0876",
      "reading_order": 1011,
      "section": "Alarm mode",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00004,
        "t": 568.10183,
        "r": 106.61004,
        "b": 556.8618299999999
      },
      "content": "Alarm mode",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0877",
      "reading_order": 1012,
      "section": "Alarm mode",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00002999999998,
        "t": 553.58183,
        "r": 557.2100300000004,
        "b": 530.34183
      },
      "content": "When the condition monitor is in alarm mode, you should investigate the cause of the condition and make necessary corrections in a timely manner."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0878",
      "reading_order": 1013,
      "section": "Magnetic device considerations",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.000029999999995,
        "t": 523.58183,
        "r": 188.06002999999998,
        "b": 512.34183
      },
      "content": "Magnetic device considerations",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0879",
      "reading_order": 1014,
      "section": "Magnetic device considerations",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99996,
        "t": 509.06182999999993,
        "r": 548.0700400000004,
        "b": 473.82183
      },
      "content": "Be careful when you use magnetic devices in close proximity of  the condition monitor, such as magnetic vibration-monitoring probes or dial indicators. These magnetic devices can accidentally activate or deactivate the condition monitor resulting in improper alarm levels or loss of  monitoring."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0880",
      "reading_order": 1015,
      "section": "Pump operation precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.993930000000006,
        "t": 455.69061999999997,
        "r": 270.9219300000001,
        "b": 437.83462
      },
      "content": "Pump operation precautions",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0881",
      "reading_order": 1016,
      "section": "General considerations",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00193000000001,
        "t": 431.06183,
        "r": 151.20193,
        "b": 419.82183
      },
      "content": "General considerations",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0089",
